          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_wHyRe8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Welcome to Footwear & Apparel New Zealand. Below you’ll find answers to common questions about ordering, payments, shipping, rural delivery, returns and security.</p><p>If you need help, contact us anytime at <strong>sales@faanz.co.nz</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Ordering & Checkout</strong></h2><p><strong>1. Can I checkout without creating an account?</strong></p><p>Yes — you can checkout as a guest without creating an account. Creating an account simply allows you to track orders and save your details for faster checkout next time.</p><p><strong>2. What currency are your prices in?</strong></p><p>All prices are in New Zealand Dollars (NZD).</p><p><strong>3. Are your prices GST inclusive?</strong></p><p>Yes — all prices include GST (Goods and Services Tax) for New Zealand customers.</p><p><strong>4. Can I cancel or change my order after placing it?</strong></p><p>If your order hasn’t been dispatched yet, we may be able to help. Please contact us as soon as possible with your order number and we’ll do our best to assist.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Payment Methods & Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL)</strong></h2><p><strong>1. What payment methods do you accept?</strong></p><p>We accept:</p><ul><li>Visa</li><li>Mastercard</li><li>American Express</li><li>PayPal</li><li>Apple Pay</li><li>Google Pay</li><li>Shop Pay</li><li>Afterpay</li></ul><p>Available options are displayed at checkout.</p><p><strong>2. Do you offer Afterpay or Buy Now Pay Later?</strong></p><p>Yes — we offer Afterpay, allowing you to split your purchase into interest-free instalments (subject to Afterpay terms and approval).</p><p><strong>3. Is it safe to use my credit card on your website?</strong></p><p>Yes. All payments are processed through secure, encrypted, PCI-compliant payment gateways such as Shopify Payments and PayPal. We do not store your full credit card details on our servers.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Privacy & Security</strong></h2><p><strong>1. How is my personal information protected?</strong></p><p>We use secure encryption (SSL technology) to protect your personal information during checkout. Your information is used only for order processing, delivery and customer service.</p><p><strong>2. Do you share my personal data?</strong></p><p>No — we do not sell or rent your personal information. Please refer to our Privacy Policy for full details.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Shipping & Delivery Within New Zealand</strong></h2><p><strong>1. Do you ship throughout New Zealand?</strong></p><p>Yes — we deliver NZ-wide, including rural addresses.</p><p><strong>2. Do you deliver to rural addresses?</strong></p><p>Yes — we ship to all rural addresses across New Zealand. Please allow an additional 1–3 working days for rural delivery.</p><p><strong>3. How long does delivery take?</strong></p><p>Estimated delivery times:</p><ul><li>Urban addresses: 2–5 working days</li><li>Rural addresses: 3–7 working days</li></ul><p>Delivery times may vary during peak periods.</p><p><strong>4. Is my order tracked?</strong></p><p>Yes — all orders are sent with tracked courier services. You will receive tracking details via email once your order has been dispatched.</p><p><strong>5. How much does shipping cost?</strong></p><p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout. Any free shipping thresholds will be displayed on our website when applicable.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Returns, Exchanges & Refunds</strong></h2><p><strong>1. What is your returns policy?</strong></p><p>We accept returns within 30 days of purchase, provided items are unworn, unused and in original condition with packaging intact.</p><p><strong>2. How do I return an item?</strong></p><p>Please email us with your order number and reason for return. We will provide return instructions.</p><p><strong>3. Can I exchange for a different size?</strong></p><p>Yes — if the size doesn’t fit, we’re happy to arrange an exchange (subject to stock availability).</p><p><strong>4. When will I receive my refund?</strong></p><p>Once we receive and inspect your returned item, refunds are processed back to your original payment method. Please allow several business days for your bank to complete the transaction.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Sizing & Product Information</strong></h2><p><strong>1. How do I choose the correct size?</strong></p><p>We provide sizing information on each product page where available. If you’re unsure, contact us and we’ll help you select the best fit.</p><p><strong>2. What if an item is out of stock?</strong></p><p>If your size is unavailable, contact us and we may be able to advise when it will be restocked.</p><p><br/></p><h2><strong>Click & Collect </strong></h2><p><strong>1. Do you offer click and collect?</strong></p><p>Yes — you may collect your order from our location during business hours. You will receive confirmation when your order is ready for pickup.</p><h2><strong>Need More Help?</strong></h2><p>If your question isn’t answered here, please contact us at:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> sales@faanz.co.nz<br/><br/><strong>Website:</strong> www.footwearandapparel.co.nz</p><p>We’re here to help and aim to respond as quickly as possible.</p>"
          }
